# Build context is the repository root. Keep it lean: ship only source + the local YandexMusic feed.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.user
**/node_modules
**/TestResults

# AI tooling / local state
.claude
.claude-flow
.swarm
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
ruvector.db
*.jsonl

# Never bake secrets into an image - production secrets are injected via env (see .env / compose).
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
*.env
.env

# Docs / compose are not needed inside the build
*.md
!README.md
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose.dcproj
run-docker-compose.bat
launchSettings.json
